# The index of a key in the table of built-in cells is the cell's number. The runtime finds it by a search, and compiled code carries the same numbers.
# Fault injection, testing=SwapBuiltinCellNumbers: the first two keys are swapped.
# AS-USERS-BUILD: the image asks in every build that the keys ascend strictly.
# DIAGNOSTIC: ProgramTableCheckFailed
# RUN: compile mechanisms=all testing=SwapBuiltinCellNumbers
# CHECK: diagnostic ProgramTableCheckFailed
# CHECK-NEXT: image empty
# -- source: main.ts
